  "foaf:name": "Women’s livelihoods in vulnerable coastlines",
  "sdo:name": "Women’s livelihoods in vulnerable coastlines",
  "sdo:description": "Pointing out the lack of gender-disaggregated data, Dr Megnaa Mehtta will investigate several forms of differentiated vulnerability among coastline resident women of the Bay of Bengal Delta, such as notably intra-household inequalities, endemic health and livelihood risks, and migration-related pressures, with a view to better inform relevant decision-making.",
